==Russian==

===Alternative forms===
* {{alt|ru|изо-||before certain consonant clusters}}
* {{alt|ru|ис-||before voiceless consonants}}

===Etymology===
{{inh+|ru|sla-pro|*jьz-}}; see {{m|sla-pro|*jьz}} for further information.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|из-|ann=y}}
* {{ru-IPA|и́з-|ann=y}} {{i|when stressed}}

===Prefix===
{{head|ru|prefix|cat2=verbal prefixes}}

# [[out]] [[from]]
#: {{prefex|ru|!изо-|-йти́|t2=to go|изойти́|t3=to emanate, to originate, to come from}}
# {{n-g|When added to a verb, it may form a verb with a sense of completeness, abundance or exhaustion.}}
#: {{prefex|ru|укра́сить|t1=to decorate|изукра́сить|t2=lavishly decorate}}
# {{n-g|When added to a verb, it may form a verb with a sense of destruction, ruined due to use.}}
#: {{prefex|ru|!ис-|писа́ть|t2=to write|исписа́ть|t3=write upon, cover with notes, write over}}
# {{n-g|When added to nouns, especially when they have the suffix -ье, it indicates location of an object.}}
#: {{prefex|ru|голова́|t1=head|-ье|изголо́вье|t3=head of the bed}}
# {{n-g|When added to adjectives for colours, an adverb is formed indicating nuance.}}
#: {{prefex|ru|жёлтый|t1=yellow|бу́рый|t2=brown|[[изжелта-|и́зжелта-бу́рый]]|t3=yellowish-brown}}
# {{n-g|When added to nouns, it may form an adverb indicating spatial or temporal properties. Usually in archaic or highly formal style.}}
#: {{prefex|ru|даль|t1=distance||alt2=-и|pos2=genitive singular|и́здали|t3=from afar}}
# {{n-g|When added to adverbs, it can form an adverb with a sense of direction for an action.}}
#: {{prefex|ru|внутри́|t1=interior, inside|изнутри́|t2=from within, from inside}}

